10 REM SHOT son (D215) : 1 laser, 2 missile, 3 rafale, 4 vitre qui casse
20 MODE 1:INK 0,1:INK 1,24:PEN 1
30 CLS:PRINT "SHOT : LES QUATRE SONS":PRINT
40 PRINT "1 : SHOT 1 (TIR DE LASER)"
50 PRINT "2 : SHOT 2 (MISSILE)"
60 PRINT "3 : SHOT 3 (RAFALE)"
70 PRINT "4 : SHOT 4 (VITRE QUI CASSE)"
80 PRINT "5 : MISSILE PUIS EXPLOSION (SHOT 2:BOOM 1)":PRINT
90 PRINT "TAPEZ 1 A 5"
100 K$=INKEY$:IF K$="" THEN 100
110 N=VAL(K$)
120 IF N>=1 AND N<=4 THEN SHOT N
130 IF N=5 THEN SHOT 2:BOOM 1
140 GOTO 100
